<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">EN_DADT mji-x-daoaodai_Dao⋅Ao⋅Dai_ltr Thu Apr 09 2026 08:29:29 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Galatians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ga-la-ti Jenx</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ga-la-ti</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt">Ga-la-ti</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Yaz, Phao-lô, ayx ah lanh cumh pâuz munh — max zâyf tăng bamh munh, yâuc max zâyf tăng laiv lanh munh taih, six tăng Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz cloon Zâu Tênb-Huungh six Pha, senz ayx phunz Nănh tăng tayc săngh taih wax Tauh — <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />cloon yaz yămz nây nyăngz yâuf pez tinyh đoih, pungx phunz yămz Ga-la-ti stâyz phangz wax đomc jiux pangx: <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Joođ Zâu Tênb-Huungh, six Pha cloon pănh nyăngz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz, sađ pôz, sađ peengh oonz phunz nyâuh, <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Nănh wâyc pănh nyăngz stoif bix sađ cănh nyăngz mengc, phunz Nănh hayh njâuv pănh gâyh đutb nâyx yenh stâyv okx nzongf nyăngz jau, âyz pănh nyăngz Pha, Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz zux ix. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Cloo phunz Nănh tuz gwăngz eeng tauv banc stâyv banc đaic. A-meen.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Yaz numđ njingc nzongf wâyc phătc nyâuh coonx winb đangz ănz nongc Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz pôz bix êu nyâuh taih wax Tauh, bix ninyh lêpc pitc huungđ Cuđ Jenx, <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />senz six max naih pitc huungđ Cuđ Jenx đêh, six wâyc naih ah phanx munh cungb oix loou ayx phunz nyâuh nyăngz nyâuđ lunc, yâuc oix tăng Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz Cuđ Jenx. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Six max cun hănđ buz, max six stinz munh tăng guungh taih, nzônh phunz nyâuh pitc huungđ Cuđ Jenx, bix max năngđ buz nzônh phunz nyâuh nyăngz Cuđ Jenx, wax tauh munh six zuc zaux. <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Cayx năngđ cah đangc buz coong quaix nâyx, six nâyx zanyf yaz zef coong ah hâyđ timb: “Năngđ coong naih laiv lanh nzônh pitc huungđ Cuđ Jenx phunz nyâuh bix max năngđ cah đangc nyâuh tuz stipx nyăngz Cuđ Jenx, wax tauh munh six zuc zaux.” <verse eid="GAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Nâyx zanyf, yaz six ayx hoopđ bamh munh nyăngz nyâuđ max six hoopđ Zâu Tênb-Huungh heh? Zâyf yaz jinh đangh lov jau ayx hoopđ munh nyăngz nyâuđ max? Năngđ coong yaz six jinh đangh ayx hoopđ munh nyăngz nyâuđ, yaz six max zâyf Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz pâuz.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Yâuf pez lex, yaz joođ bux phunz nyâuh pâyz coong, yaz nzônh nyăngz Cuđ Jenx, six max zâyf tăng bamh munh taih. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Wâyc yaz max stipx wax đomc Cuđ Jenx tăng laiv lanh munh taih, yâuc max tuz tăng laiv lanh munh nzaox phunz yaz, nây six tăng Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz cănh hinđ yangh phunz yaz. <verse eid="GAL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Nzof nyâuh lauf cănh tuz numđ coong tauv yaz cah đangc lêpc Yu-tai munh nyăngz gâyf wax zanyf, yaz six ayx huđ ănz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz jiux pangx, yâuc lov jau mêtc wax đomc munh. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Yaz hoođ pâyz Yu-tai munh wax đomc gâyf yâuc max stâyv cloon yaz panz toongv wax đomc Yu-tai munh tauv laiv, yâuc joomz nyâuđ nzongf claof jex buz njăpc taih wax đomc gâyf. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Six tăng yaz năngx yămz nzif nyăngz nyâuđ njaf wax zanyf, Zâu Tênb-Huungh bix lanyc yaz taih, nongc Nănh nyăngz pôz êu yaz taih, yâuc numđ nyađ <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />hinđ manyf Nănh nyăngz Toonz yămz yaz cah njaf, phunz yaz hayh nzônh wax tauh Toonz yămz wax đomc pitc stingx munh cah njaf, yaz songđ lênh dlih max cloon bamh munh sangv, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />nzof yaz yâuc max ninyh wa Yê-lu-sa-lem pongh ayx cumh pâuz munh đangc yaz wax đomc. Six, yaz ninyh wa A-la-bi, nzof nzăngđ phunb đangz lauf wa Đa-mat dlanyh.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Tăng wa, pôz nyăngv cah đangz, yaz nzăngđ ninyh wa Yê-lu-sa-lem cloon Sê-pha tinyh quênx yâuc cloon nănh yămz tuz săpc ngâuf noib. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Six yaz max pongh wax đomc cumh pâuz munh lanh tiny, blătc nzuf Ya-coopc, Zâu nyăngz yâuf. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Yămz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz cah đangc, yaz ja nâyx đomc wac phunz nyâuh six senz nyăngz, yaz max coong jaf. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Blătc wa, yaz zef ninyh Si-li cloon Si-li-si wax đomc stâyz phangz. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Wax zanyf, yămz Yu-đê stâyz phangz wax đomc Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz jiux pangx lauf max zeengx pâyz yaz. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Six wax đomc zen Zâu nyăngz munh yâuc tuz numđ coong: “Cah đangc ayx huđ ănz pănh wax tauh nâyx zanyf jinh đangh nzônh cah đangc nănh lov jau mêtc wax huungđ gâyf,” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />stiz songđ wâyc yaz bix tanv Zâu Tênb-Huungh.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Tăng wa săpc stâyx nyăngv cah đangz, yaz zef cloon Ba-na-batc ninyh wa Yê-lu-sa-lem, yâuc ênz cloon Ti-tatc ninyh. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Wax zanyf, âyz hinđ yangh nyăngz jau, yaz ninyh wa nzônh Cuđ Jenx phunz stiz, cayx năngđ yaz nzônh phunz wax đomc pitc stingx munh nâyx, six cungb lanyc coong ănz wax đomc naih minb mâyc njăngb nyăngz munh cuungv, cungb wangb săngx đanyf yaz hănđ tiuv lauf cungb tiuv bix max setb laiv huungđ. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Max cun Ti-tatc six Hi-lapc munh, cloon yaz ninyh, yâuc max zuc yac ayx quaix catz. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Buz ayx năngđ nâyx six wâyc naih ah phanx za nyăngz munh, stiz nimx nzac taih nongc seetx mangc buz tuz pungx goib nyăngz jau, senz buz yămz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz bix tuz pungx goib nyăngz jau, phunz stiz hayh zoz buz nongc ayx nâuh, <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />wâyc nây buz songđ max nyangc nănh stiz tix cay tiny, phunz Cuđ Jenx nyăngz senz gâyf hayh tuz stâyv quâyx yămz cloon nyâuh. <verse eid="GAL 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Nzof coong tauv wax đomc naih minb mâyc njăngb nyăngz munh (cah đangc stiz six năngđ laix yâuc max quenđ tauv yaz ax tiny; wâyc Zâu Tênb-Huungh six max pyac toix laiv lanh) — wax đomc munh hănđ six naih minb mâyc njăngb lauf max stăngc tuz yaz laiv huungđ tiny. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Six, tauv pâyz tuz coong yaz tuz jaoz phunz nongc nzônh Cuđ Jenx phunz max quaix catz nyăngz munh, cayx năngđ Pi-tê tuz jaoz phunz nongc nzônh Cuđ Jenx phunz ayx quaix catz nyăngz munh nâyx <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />(wâyc ayx phunz Pi-tê săngh cumh pâuz munh yămz wax đomc ayx quaix catz nyăngz munh wax Tauh, lauf ayx phunz yaz săngh cumh pâuz munh yămz wax đomc pitc stingx munh), <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />tauv pâyz tuz coong Zâu nyăngz pôz tuz sađ phunz yaz, Ya-coopc, Sê-pha, cloon Yô-hanx, six ayx coonz nyăngz munh, songđ stuungb byaoh puf cloon buz tinyh tokb, six Ba-na-batc cloon yaz, phunz buz six huungv staox wax đomc pitc stingx munh ninyh, nzof stiz six huungv staox wax đomc ayx quaix catz nyăngz munh ninyh, <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />yâuc zăpx coong buz oix zuc săngx tauv munh zâuđ munh, six lauf yaz jinh đangh joomz nyâuđ ayx nyăngz cumh pâuz.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Six tauv Sê-pha ninyh tauv An-ti-ôkx dlanyh, yaz songđ toongx minb mađ nănh wâyc nănh payh tuz zuc mađ. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Wâyc Ya-coopc wax đomc munh taih max zeengx tauv wax zanyf, nănh six cloon wax đomc pitc stingx munh songđ nhlinc. Six tauv stiz taih, nănh lov jau tiuv ninyh cănh yămz lanyc, wâyc cumh nzav wax đomc ayx quaix catz nyăngz munh. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Nzof wax đomc Yu-tai munh songđ âyz nănh nyăngz gao ayx, ayx tuz njinh Ba-na-batc lauf zuc hox âyz stiz wax huungđ pâyh zac nyâuđ yootz nyăngz gao. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Six tauv yaz phătc stiz jinh đangh max âyz Cuđ Jenx nyăngz senz gâyf ayx, yaz songx toongx songx mađ Sê-pha, coong: “Năngđ coong mâyh six Yu-tai munh, bix yămz ayx cayx năngđ pitc stingx munh max năngđ Yu-tai munh, mâyh bix laiv ayx laix hayh yac êu pitc stingx munh zuc yămz ayx cayx năngđ Yu-tai munh heh?” <verse eid="GAL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Buz tăng steengb taih six Yu-tai munh, max zâyf tăng pitc stingx naih stoif nyăngz munh setb taih; <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Six wâyc pâyz tuz coong max naih laiv lanh păngc yămz ayx âyz gâyf njanh bix tuz stunx ayx peengh stimz, blătc nzuf păngc zen yămz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz, wâyc nây buz songđ nongc nyâuđ zen caođ Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz, phunz buz tuz stunx ayx peengh stimz, păngc zen yămz Zâu Jix-Tuz bix max zâyf păngc yămz ayx âyz gâyf njanh. Wâyc muif lanh munh six max hayh tuz stunx ayx peengh stimz yămz ayx âyz gâyf njanh nyăngz jau. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Six năngđ coong, buz jinh đangh lov jau ayx phunz tuz stunx ayx peengh stimz yămz Zâu Jix-Tuz, buz bix zuc mangc ayx cayx năngđ cay naih stoif nyăngz munh, ha nâyx Zâu Jix-Tuz six taih ayx nâuh phunz stoif yah? Cănh mayv zâyf nâyx! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Wâyc năngđ coong yaz zef ninyh zâyv yaz toou lunc nyăngz tax huungđ, yaz six cănh hinđ manyf coong yaz six ayx longđ nyăngz munh. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Wâyc zuc yămz gâyf njanh yaz six tayc cloon gâyf njanh, phunz yaz hayh tuz săngh wâyc Zâu Tênb-Huungh. Yaz zuc tingz jămz ănz săpc đăngc zax cloon Zâu Jix-Tuz nzof, <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />wâyc nây max zâyf yaz săngh nzof, six Zâu Jix-Tuz săngh yămz yaz cah njaf. Nâyx zanyf yaz năngx jinh săngh yămz nây stinb a nyăngz săngx huđ, yaz six săngh wâyc zen caođ Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz toonz, senz stăngz yaz bix sađ Nănh cănh nyăngz mengc tayv phunz yaz wax Tauh. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Yaz max quanyf Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pôz đêh, wâyc năngđ coong păngc gâyf njanh bix tuz stunx ayx peengh stimz, têx Zâu Jix-Tuz tayc six max setb laiv huungđ!<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Ô nyâuh đomc Ga-la-ti munh oongx lex! Mănv ayx jeengz stâyz ănz nyâuh, ayx tuz toongx nyâuh nyăngz minb, Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz bix zuc tingz jămz ănz săpc đăngc zax manyf tuz nâyx nzof? <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Yaz cungb oix naic nyâuh nâyx zâux wac cuungv: Nyâuh tuz stipx Singx-Lingh six păngc âyz gâyf njanh ayx max six păngc mungv bix zen heh? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Săngh laix nyâuh bix oongx tuz nâyx heh? Nyâuh quef coonz tăng Zâu Singx-Lingh nâyx zanyf zef oix âyz stinb a bix pac? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Nyâuh cayx ayx phunz nyâuh tanyđ quaix taih nyăngz zâuđ nanc pênx max setb laiv huungđ mah? — Năngđ coong nâyx six senz max setb luungđ gôh! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Ha Zâu Tênb-Huungh sađ Singx-Lingh phunz nyâuh yâuc ayx wax đomc jix caox njingc yămz nyâuh cah njaf, wax đomc six păngc yămz ayx âyz gâyf njanh, max six păngc yămz mungv bix zen heh? <verse eid="GAL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Năngđ Apx-la-ham “zen caođ Zâu Tênb-Huungh, nănh bix tuz stunx hipđ ayx peengh stimz,” <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />năngđ nây oix zuc pâyz coong laiv lanh naih zen stimz, six săngh Apx-la-ham nyăngz sây stunz. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Six tauv pâyz tuz coong Zâu Tênb-Huungh stunx pitc stingx munh ayx peengh stimz yămz zen stimz, wâyc Canyx stâub coong tauv nây Cuđ Jenx quaix đangc phunz Apx-la-ham coong: “Tăng mâyh manf stingx munh six tuz pôz.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Wâyc nây, laiv lanh naih zen stimz six tuz pôz cloon Apx-la-ham, naih zen stimz nyăngz munh. <verse eid="GAL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Pâyz sax lanh munh păngc ayx âyz gâyf njanh yâuc jinh đangh zuc zaux; wâyc naih ja coong: “Laiv lanh max nongc nyâuđ âyz ja yămz gâyf njanh stâub wax đomc gâyf ayx six payh tuz zuc zaux.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Six wâyc max naih mănv hayh păngc gâyf njanh bix tuz stunx ayx peengh stimz yămz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz cah đangc, wâyc “peengh stimz nyăngz munh six săngh păngc yămz zen stimz.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Nzof gâyf njanh six max zâyf tăng zen stimz taih, six “laiv lanh ayx wax đomc gâyf njanh nyăngz cumh pâuz six păngc wa bix săngh.” <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Zâu Jix-Tuz suc pănh tuz gâyh đutb zuc zaux yămz gâyf njanh nyăngz jau, songđ cănh tanyđ zuc zaux tayv phunz pănh — wâyc naih wac ja coong: “Laiv lanh zuc tingz ănz săpc đăngc zax senz payh tuz zuc zaux gôh” — <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />phunz Apx-la-ham nyăngz pôz tuz ninyh phunz tauv pitc stingx munh yămz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz, phunz pănh hayh tuz stipx nyunc sađ phunz nyăngz Singx-Lingh păngc yămz zen stimz.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Yâuf pez lex, yaz âyz bamh munh nyăngz zux ix coong. Hănđ ayx laix, lauf max naih mănv hayh quanyf max six pâu ănz munh njăpc quaix nyăngz nyunc wac. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Nzof, wax đomc nyunc nyăngz wac six tuz coong phunz Apx-la-ham cloon nănh nyăngz sây stunz, wax zâux wac max coong “phunz cloon wax đomc sây stunz” năngđ si tauv đuungx lanh munh, six coong “phunz cloon mâyh nyăngz sây stunz” nây six si tauv ah lanh munh, nzof nâyx lanh munh six Zâu Jix-Tuz. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Six yaz oix coong: Ayx tuz tauv stâyx pez stamx săpc njăngv cah đangz, gâyf njanh lauf max hayh ayx phunz Zâu Tênb-Huungh njăpc quaix nyăngz nyunc nhlengc wac stam ninyh. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Wâyc zuc năngđ coong nyunc phunz nyăngz phănc six tăng Gâyf njanh taih, têx six max zâyf tăng nyunc nyăngz wac nzof. Six Zâu Tênb-Huungh sađ pôz phunz Apx-la-ham six tăng nyunc nyăngz wac. <verse eid="GAL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Ha nâyx, gâyf njanh six nongc ayx luungđ heh? Gâyf njanh tuz njăpc taih six wâyc ayx longđ nyăngz jau, tuz paiđ phunz tăng wax đomc stinz munh jaoz tauv ah lanh mungh tongx munh, zu tauv laiv zanyf wax tauh sây stunz taih tauv, nzof nyunc nyăngz wac yâuc tuz njăpc taih yămz wax tauh sây stunz. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Six mungh tongx munh six max zâyf cungb nongc phunz ah leepb cuungv, nzof Zâu Tênb-Huungh six cungb ah tauh đokc. <verse eid="GAL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Ha nâyx, gâyf njanh six nzeengz cloon nyunc nyăngz wac max six heh? Yâuc max zâyf! Wâyc zuc năngđ coong gâyf njanh tuz sađ phunz bix năngx hayh ayx phunz tuz săngh, têx peengh stimz nyăngz jau six bâyf lauf tăng gâyf njanh taih. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Six Canyx Stâub zoz muif huungđ clăngđ ănz stoif nyăngz cah đi nzuf, nongc phunz păngc zen yămz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz, bix nyunc nyăngz wac nzăngđ tuz sađ phunz wax đomc naih nyâuđ zen nyăngz munh.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Cah đangc nâyx huungđ zen stimz max zeengx taih nyăngz săngx huđ, pănh six zuc clăngđ yămz gâyf njanh cah đi, zuc clăngđ ayx tuz tauv zen stimz tuz hinđ manyf setb taih. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Ayx tuz, gâyf njanh pênx ah lanh munh jămđ nzaox pănh nongc phunz Zâu Jix-Tuz, phunz pănh nzăngđ hayh tuz stunx ayx peengh stimz yămz zen stimz. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Six tauv zen stimz taih, pănh nzăngđ max zuc yămz jămđ nzaox wax tauh nyăngz puf đi. <verse eid="GAL 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Wâyc nyâuh muif lanh six păngc zen yămz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz, bix săngh Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz toonz sab. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Wâyc zuc Tinyh phanv laiv lanh ayx quaix-gâyf yămz Zâu Jix-Tuz, six tuz cloon Zâu Jix-Tuz songc mengc săngh. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Max cănh lanyc Yu-tai munh max six Hi-lapc munh, max cănh lanyc ayx nâuh max six max ayx nâuh, max cănh lanyc toonz max six sab, wâyc zuc nyâuh yetx stong six tinyh songc yămz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz nzuf. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Nzof năngđ coong nyâuh six săngh Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz, nyâuh six lauf săngh Apx-la-ham nyăngz sây stunz, senz tuz stipx nyunc phunz nyăngz phănc wax đomc munh.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Six yaz oix coong tinyh phanv tuz stipx phănc nyăngz munh năngx jinh ayx munh sây nyăngz săngx huđ, nănh six lauf cayx năngđ ah lanh nâuh munh, max cun nănh six wax đomc muif huungđ jax toongx nyăngz zâu. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Wax tauh munh six zuc wax đomc jămđ nănh nyăngz munh cun ayx tuz tauv beengc nănh nyăngz pha tingc taih nyăngz săngx huđ. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Lauf tinyh năngđ, laiv zanyf pănh năngx jinh ayx munh sây, pănh six năngx zuc ayx nâuh phunz nây bamh canz nyăngz jau. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Six tauv beengc săngđ huđ, Zâu Tênb-Huungh songđ paiđ Nănh nyăngz toonz, taih steengb stâyv tăng ah lanh munh nzif, yâuc steengb yămz gâyf njanh cah đi, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />nongc phunz Nănh suc yămz gâyf njanh cah đi wax đomc munh, phunz pănh hayh tuz stipx ayx săngh sây hoonb. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Nzof, wâyc nyâuh six sây, Zâu Tênb-Huungh songđ sađ Nănh nyăngz toonz nyăngz Singx-Lingh taih yămz pănh nyăngz nyâuđ, hamv coong: “A-ba, Pha.” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Wâyc nây, nyâuh max zâyf ayx nâuh munh nzof, six ayx sây, nzof năngđ coong ayx sây, six lauf săngh tuz stipx Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz phănc wax đomc munh.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Six cah đangc, max zeengx pâyz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz săngx huđ, nyâuh six zuc ayx nâuh phunz wax đomc max naih luungđ stuyh nyăngz miuc hanyh. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Six nâyx zanyf nyâuh tuz pâyz tauv Zâu Tênb-Huungh, năngx toix têx six coong tuz Zâu Tênb-Huungh pâyz tauv, săngh laix nyâuh bix zef năngx muf lov wax đomc max naih luungđ stuyh yâuc max setb luungđ nyăngz jau heh, nyâuh zef năngx numđ oix ayx nâuh phunz stiz ah hâyđ timb mah? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Nyâuh lauf năngx ninyh tex noib, lav, zunb stêtz, cloon njăngv! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Yaz numđ stauh phunz nyâuh, cungb wangb yaz ayx cumh pâuz zâuđ yămz nyâuh cah njaf bix max setb laiv huungđ.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Yâuf pez lex, yaz joođ nyâuh oix zuc ayx cayx năngđ yaz nâyx, wâyc yaz lauf cayx năngđ nyâuh. Nyâuh max ayx phunz yaz stâyb luungđ ax tinyh. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Nyâuh pâyz coong tăng nâyx nomz munz đoonh nyăngz stinb, yaz bix nzônh Cuđ Jenx phunz nyâuh tah yetx hâyđ. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Yaz nyăngz stinb đoonh six săngh stâyv nyâuđ phunz nyâuh, nyâuh yâuc max mangc stam yaz, yâuc max nzêmh yaz, nzof nyâuh yâuc năngx stipx yaz cayx năngđ Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz ah tauh stinz munh, yâuc cayx năngđ Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Năngđ nây, nyâuh numđ nyađ wax đomc yămz laiv nzof heh? Wâyc yaz ayx zanyx manyf phunz nyâuh coong, wax zanyf năngđ coong hayh, nyâuh lôx năngx ngwâyz nyâuh nyăngz mâyc, stungx phunz yaz. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Ha nâyx, wâyc yaz coong senz ănz nyâuh, yaz bix săngh nyâuh nyăngz yônz zaz mah? <verse eid="GAL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Wax đomc munh joomz nyâuđ ănz nyâuh, six max zâyf naih nyâuđ gongx đêh, stiz six oix njeengx nyâuh cloon buz tinyh gâyh, nongc phunz nyâuh joomz nyâuđ cloon stiz cuungv lêc. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Muif dlih joomz nyâuđ ayx gongx nzăngđ zâyf senz gongx, max zâyf cungb laiv zanyf yaz naih minb cloon nyâuh yămz nzăngđ ayx. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Yaz nyăngz sây lex, wâyc nyâuh yaz bix zef zuc tanyđ munz sây gumc, ayx tuz tauv laiv zanyf Zâu Jix-Tuz săngh hanyh yămz nyâuh cah njaf — <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />six, yaz numđ oix nâyx zanyf tuz cloon nyâuh yămz bix wănc yaz nyăngz wac coong, wâyc yaz numđ stauh nyâuh nzongf.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Nyâuh đomc oix yămz gâyf njanh cah đi nyăngz munh lex, oix zuc phunz yaz pâyz, nyâuh max mungv gâyf njanh haz? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Wâyc naih wac ja coong Apx-la-ham naih iz lanh toonz, ah lanh six nâuh nyăngz munh nzif steengb, nzof ah lanh six pungx goib nyăngz munh nzif steengb. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Six, tăng ayx nâuh wax tauh munh nzif steengb nyăngz toonz six âyz nây stinb a, nzof tăng pungx goib wax tauh munh nzif steengb nyăngz toonz six âyz nyunc nyăngz wac. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Nâyx đomc jau six tuz coong tauv nongc ayx cayx năngđ ah cuyb wac pây nâyx, wâyc wa iz lanh munh nzif six săngh iz huungđ nhlengc wac. Ah huungđ nhlengc wac yămz wa Si-nai zoongz, steengb sây taih nongc ayx nâuh. Nây six Ha-ga. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Ha-ga six Si-nai zoongz yămz wa A-la-bi stâyz phangz, yâuc jangx pây nâyx zanyf nyăngz Yê-lu-sa-lem dlanyh, wâyc wax nomz dlanyh cloon nănh nyăngz toonz sab jinh đangh zuc ayx nâuh. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Six yămz cah zâyc guungh nyăngz Yê-lu-sa-lem dlanyh six tuz pungx goib, nzof nây six pănh nyăngz nzif. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Wâyc naih wac ja coong:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">“Max naih sây nyăngz munh nzif lex, oix zuc numđ nyađ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Max zeengx tuz munz quaix steengb sây gumc nyăngz munh nzif lex, oix zuc hamv stingb nyađ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Wâyc zuc queengx wax tauh munh nzif nyăngz sây six năngx đuungx têx, naih langh wax tauh munh nzif nyăngz sây.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Yâuf pez lex, nâyx zanyf nyâuh six săngh nyunc wac nyăngz toonz sab, cayx năngđ I-sakx nâyx. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Six, lauf năngđ lôx noib nâyx, âyz stinb a steengb wax tauh sây ayx hoiđ âyz Singx-Lingh steengb wax tauh ayx năngđ laix, nâyx zanyf six lauf năngđ wa nâyx. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Six Canyx Stâub coong ayx laix heh? “Oix zuc luiđ ayx nâuh wax tauh munh nzif cloon nănh nyăngz toonz. Wâyc zuc ayx nâuh wax tauh munh nzif nyăngz toonz six max hayh tuz cloon pungx goib wax tauh munh nzif nyăngz nyăngz toonz songc stipx phănc.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Wâyc nây, yâuf pez lex, pănh six max zâyf ayx nâuh wax tauh munh nzif nyăngz sây, pănh six ayx pungx goib wax tauh munh nzif nyăngz sây.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Zâu Jix-Tuz zay phunz pănh tuz pungx goib. Wâyc nây, oix zuc stâuđ năngx tăngđ yâuc gâyf năngx ninyh đamz ayx nâuh nyăngz bănx tanz gôh.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Oix zuc mungv năngx gongx, yaz, Phao-lô, coong ănz nyâuh coong, năngđ coong nyâuh numđ sămv zuc ayx quaix catz, têx Zâu Jix-Tuz six max hayh stăngc tuz nyâuh laiv huungđ ax tiny. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Yaz coong ah hâyđ timb phunz wax đomc ayx quaix catz nyăngz munh tauv laiv, stiz senz oix zuc ayx âyz muif tiuh gâyf njanh năngx nzuf. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Nyâuh laiv lanh oix păngc gâyf njanh phunz tuz stunx ayx peengh stimz songđ zuc gâyh goib Zâu Jix-Tuz, yâuc pungx đutb Zâu nyăngz pôz gôh. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Nzof năngx naih pănh six păngc Singx-Lingh, păngc zen stimz, pănh bix sâub sâuđ zu naih njih mungc tauv peengh stimz nyăngz jau. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Wâyc yămz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz cah njaf, nongc sen nyăngz six max zâyf ayx quaix catz max six max ayx, nongc sen six oix zuc naih zen stimz bix zef naih lanh stăngz lanh. <verse eid="GAL 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Nyâuh six jinh đangh tiuv gongx tuz nâyx lec. Mănv tăng ayx phunz nyâuh max buc senz gâyf heh? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Stiz hox nyăngz jau six max zâyf tăng êu nyâuh taih wax Tauh! <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Tix cay piny ayx phunz njinh săngh tungđ văn phutx nzuf. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Yămz Zâu cah njaf, yaz zen coong, nyâuh six max cănh nyâyh njingc ninyh. Six, laiv tauh ayx phunz nyâuh nyâuđ lunc songđ zuc tingc stoif, max cun wax tauh munh six mănv. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Six, yâuf pez lex, năngđ coong yaz năngx jinh nzônh ayx quaix catz nyăngz gâyf ha săngh laix yaz bix năngx zuc ayx huđ heh? Năngđ nâyx têx wâyc săpc đăngc zax bix pamf nyăngz jau six tuz quanyf nzuf nzec. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Yaz oix nongc loou ayx phunz nyâuh nyâuđ lunc wax đomc munh, wănh cănh imz stiz zef.<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Yâuf pez lex, nyâuh tuz sên taih six nongc ayx pungx goib nyăngz munh, nzof tuz pungx goib nyăngz jau six max zâyf phunz pănh taih nongc ayx âyz stinb a oix nyăngz jau, plănc taih, six oix zuc lanh stăngc lanh yămz stăngz nyăngz jau. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Wâyc muif tiuh gâyf njanh nyăngz lanyf six tuz ayx clăkx clunh nzuf yămz ah tiuh lanyf, coong: “Mâyh oix zuc stăngz mâyh nyăngz cah sinh munh cayx năngđ cănh nyăngz stinb nâyx.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Six năngđ coong nyâuh lanh zef tăpc lanh yâuc lanh naz lanh, six oix zuc năngx cayb, sangx nyâuh cănh lanh ayx phunz lanh zuc stutc nzuf.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Năngđ nây, yaz bux coong, oix zuc phunz Singx-Lingh yenv, nyâuh nzăngđ max ayx âyz stinb a oix nyăngz jau. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Wâyc stinb a oix nyăngz jau six nzeengz cloon Singx-Lingh, nzof Singx-Lingh oix nyăngz jau yâuc nzeengz cloon stinb a. Wâyc iz leepb six tinyh tămx tinyh nzeengz, wâyc nây six max naih coong bix tinyh phanv nyâuh oix ayx laiv huungđ, bix ayx. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Năngđ coong nyâuh tuz Singx-Lingh yenv, nyâuh six max yămz gâyf njanh cah đi. <verse eid="GAL 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Stinb a oix nyăngz jau six hinđ manyf taih năngđ nây nâyx, wax đomc six: pongz lauh, max đăngb zeengh, loongh cloongb, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />paix miuc hanyh, ayx papz, tinyh panx, tinyh nzeengz, stâyx munz, siv totc, tinyh hănđ, max hoopđ stimz, phunz goib ayx sax peob, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />numđ hănđ, tiu binz, nyađ nhlinc hopb cloon đuungx huungđ năngđ nây nâyx, yămz wax đomc jau, yaz quinb bux nyâuh, cayx năngđ cah đangc yaz quinb bux nyâuh nâyx, coong laiv lanh ayx wax đomc jau năngđ nâyx six max tuz stipx Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz. <verse eid="GAL 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Nzof Singx-Lingh nyăngz cumh pâuz jau, six lanh stăngz lanh, numđ nyađ, peengh oonz, nyâuđ đao, wăn, dlênc, ayx nyâuđ zanyx, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />dlênc stimz dlênc âyx, hayh cun tuz cănh; max naih laiv tiuh gâyf njanh bix nzeengz cloon nâyx đomc jau. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Nzof, laiv lanh săngh Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz nyăngz munh, six zoz stinb a oix nyăngz jau cloon stâyx munz oix nongc tauv laiv wax đomc tingz ănz săpc đăngc zax nzuf.<verse eid="GAL 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Năngđ coong pănh mungc Singx-Lingh săngh, pănh six oix zuc phunz Singx-Lingh yenv pănh. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Năngx gâyf cungb tâuh cănh tuz gongx bix lanh ayx peo lanh yâuc lanh hănđ lanh.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Yâuf pez lex, năngđ coong phătc naih tix lanh munh longđ tix huungđ stoif, nyâuh naih Singx-Lingh nyăngz munh oix zuc nongc nyâuđ dlênc ênz nănh phunb đangz lauf, six nyâuh oix zuc năngx cayb bôngh, săngx đanyf nyâuh lôx năngx zuc đănx ninyh. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Pongh zâuđ nanc nyăngz jau oix zuc lanh stăngc lanh đamz, năngđ nây nyâuh six ayx tuz clăkx clunh nzuf yămz Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz gâyf. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Wâyc zuc năngđ coong naih tix lanh munh numđ nănh ayx lub, bix yâuc max setb laiv huungđ tiny, têx nănh six cănh jaf nănh. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Muif lanh munh six oix zuc zah mangc cănh nyăngz cumh pâuz jau, ayx năngđ nâyx nănh six cănh naih jau tanv nănh, yâuc max zâuđ năngx zuc pây cloon pitc lanh munh. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Wâyc mănv six cănh zuc đamz mănv nyăngz đamx.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Nzof, tuz munh nzaox gâyf phunz nyăngz munh six oix zuc tanb muif huungđ gongx nyăngz tungh zăngc phunz cloon nzaox nănh wax tauh munh. <verse eid="GAL 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Năngx gâyf phunz zuc jaf. Zâu Tênb-Huungh six max nyenc zuc mangc stam, tinyh phanv laiv lanh songx luungđ six tuz sâub luungđ. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Laiv lanh songx yămz cănh nyăngz stinb a six tăng stinb a sâub zuc mêtc nyăngz jau. Nzof laiv lanh songx yămz Singx-Lingh six tăng Singx-Lingh sâub tuz stâyv quâyx nyăngz mengc. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Pănh ayx gongx nyăngz jau năngx gâyf numđ ngăngc, wâyc năngđ coong pănh max tuih nyâuđ têx, tauv beengc săngx huđ, pănh six tuz sâub cah đany. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Wâyc nây, nâyx zanyf pănh năngx jinh naih săngx huđ congv, pănh six oix zuc ayx gongx phunz munh, nongc sen six ayx phunz zen Zâu munh săngh ah sênz pyau munh wax đomc.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Phanv mangc yaz nongc cănh nyăngz puf ja jenx phunz nyâuh đăngc lub tuz năngđ nâyx. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Pâyz sax lanh munh six cungb oix cayx manyh yangh yămz nây stinb a cuungv, stiz yac nyâuh ayx quaix catz, wâyc phunz stiz max zuc munh ayx huđ yămz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz nyăngz săpc đăngc zax. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Wâyc njinh stiz wax đomc ayx quaix catz nyăngz munh lôx max âyz gâyf njanh ayx, six stiz oix nongc nyâuh ayx quaix catz, nongc phunz stiz hayh ayx nzetx lub tanv yămz nyâuh nyăngz stinb a. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Yămz yaz, six max numđ naih luungđ săngh nongc ayx nzetx lub tanv, blătc nzuf tanv pănh nyăngz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz nyăngz săpc đăngc zax, wâyc yămz nây săpc đăngc zax, yaz stunx bamh canz six cayx năngđ zuc tingz ănz săpc đangc zax nâyx, nzof yaz lauf năngđ ha yămz nây bamh canz. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Yâuc max zâyf coong tauv ayx quaix catz max six max quaix catz, nây six coong tauv ah huungđ săngb nyăngz. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Nzof tinyh phanv laiv lanh năngđ nây nâyx ayx, Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz peengh oonz cloon hâuđ lênh munh nyăngz nyâuđ six yămz stiz, yâuc yămz I-sa-la-ên munh.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Tuz mungc tăng nây staox ninyh, max naih mănv năngx ayx phunz yaz zuc zâuđ, wâyc yămz yaz nyăngz stinb jinh đangh nzâyz Zâu Yê-su nyăngz paz.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Yâuf pez lex, cloo pănh nyăngz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz nyăngz pôz, yămz nyâuh nyăngz stimz nyâuđ. A-meen.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>